  "lineage": "Ritual song and drumming of the Dogon of the Bandiagara Escarpment, performed at funerals and at the dama, the collective end-of-mourning rite in which masked dancers escort the souls of the dead away from the village. Mourning songs (baja ni) are sung for the deceased, and drum ensembles accompany the mask dances. Generic membrane-drum cards stand in for the Dogon drums.",
